        "text": {
            "description_html": "<a name=\"LAU-37406\"><b>Laurey 37406, Hammered Merlot Cabinet Knob in Antique Pewter</b></a>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Antique Pewter Hammered Cabinet Knob features a unique hammered design that is huge in art deco design. This Antique Pewter Hammered Cabinet Knob is easy to install and comes with the installation screws. The Merlot Cabinet Knob has a 1-3/8 inch diameter with a 1-1/4 inch projection. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet knob is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=Laurey+Merlot\">Laurey Merlot Collection</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey 37406 Antique Pewter Merlot Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Antique Pewter</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screw and 1-1/2\" long #8-32 screw.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available finishes:</b>\r\n<table width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"#LAU-37406\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-37406-SM.jpg?v=1704354614\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\" alt=\"LAU-37406\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/oil-rubbed-bronze-hammered-cabinet-knob-laurey-37466\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-37466-SM.jpg?v=1704354614\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\" alt=\"LAU-37466\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/matte-black-hammered-cabinet-knob-laurey-37420\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-37420-SM.jpg?v=1704354614\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\" alt=\"LAU-37420\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/satin-nickel-hammered-cabinet-knob-laurey-37428\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-37428-SM.jpg?v=1704354614\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\" alt=\"LAU-37428\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/satin-brass